/dd></div>\n            </dl>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Right Column: Factual Supported Media Specification Table -->\n          <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 bg-soft border border-line rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"px-5 py-4 border-b border-line bg-white flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n              <div>\n                <h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-base text-ink\">Supported Media &amp; Format Reference</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted\">Factual capabilities for publicly accessible TikTok links</p>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted tabular-nums\">2 Tool Categories</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n              <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr class=\"border-b border-line bg-soft/70 text-ink-secondary font-semibold\">\n                    <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Media Category</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">URL Pattern</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Preview &amp; Output</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">Access Scope</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-line bg-white tabular-nums\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-ink\">Photo &amp; Carousel</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-ink-muted\"><code>/@creator/photo/{id}</code></td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-ink-secondary\">JPEG / WebP at source quality</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3.5 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 font-medium text-xs\">Public posts</span></td>\n                  </tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/60\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-ink\">TikTok Video</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">/@creator/video/{id}</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">MP4 at source quality</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Public videos</td></tr>\n                  \n                  \n                  \n                  \n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"px-5 py-3 bg-soft border-t border-line text-xs text-ink-muted\">\n              Note: Private, unavailable and login-restricted posts cannot be accessed. Media resolution depends on the source file uploaded to TikTok.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ SECTION (Accessible Accordions) -->\n    <section id=\"faq-section\" class=\"py-12 sm:py-16 bg-soft border-t border-line px-4 sm:px-6\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[840px] mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"text-center max-w-[560px] mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-10\">\n          <h2 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink leading-tight\">\n            Frequently Asked Questions\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-muted\">\n            Clear answers about supported TikTok links, quality options, privacy, and mobile usage.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-3\" id=\"faq-accordion-list\">\n          <!-- FAQ 1 -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-line rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n            <h3>\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                aria-expanded=\"true\"\n                aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\"\n                id=\"faq-btn-1\"\n                class=\"faq-toggle-btn w-full min-h-[54px] px-5 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base text-ink hover:bg-soft/50 cursor-pointer ui-transition\"\n              >\n                <span>Which TikTok links are supported by TikSaveMP4?</span>\n                <svg class=\"faq-chevron w-4 h-4 text-brand-violet shrink-0 rotate-180 ui-transition\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg>\n              </button>\n            </h3>\n            <div id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" class=\"px-5 pb-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-line/60 pt-3\">Public TikTok video and photo post links are supported, including official vm.tiktok.com, vt.tiktok.com and tiktok.com/t/ share links. Profile, live and private links are not supported.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- FAQ 2 -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-line rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n            <h3>\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\"\n                id=\"faq-btn-2\"\n                class=\"faq-toggle-btn w-full min-h-[54px] px-5 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-display font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base text-ink hover:bg-soft/50 cursor-pointer ui-transition\"\n              >\n                <span>Can I download photos or videos from a private TikTok account?</span>\n                <svg class=\"faq-chevron w-4 h-4 text-ink-muted shrink-0 ui-transition\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg>\n              </button>\n            </h3>\n            <div id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" class=\"hidden px-5 pb-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed border-t border-line/60 pt-3\">\n              No. TikSaveMP4 respects account privacy settings and does not access private profiles, private posts, or age-restricted posts that require user authentication.\n            </div>\n       